      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的玛沙那\n很难坚持集中注意力。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62117684739B6C9990A3000A5F8896BE575A630196C64E2D6CE8610F529B300200100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "既然如此，我只好去请求\n传说中的瑜伽大师来指导我们了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65E2713659826B64FF0C621153EA597D53BB8BF76C42000A4F208BF44E2D7684745C4F3D59275E08676563075BFC62114EEC4E86FF0100100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有传闻说，\n传说中的瑜伽大师会在<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n5个圆形之中<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>0点的位置<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>修行。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67094F2095FB8BF4FF0C000A4F208BF44E2D7684745C4F3D59275E084F1A572800100001BE00000A00354E2A57065F624E4B4E2D00100002FF000006003070B976844F4D7F6E00100002FF0000004FEE884C300200100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "听说瑜伽大师就在那个圆中\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>最接近天空的地方<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "542C8BF4745C4F3D59275E085C31572890A34E2A57064E2D000A00100002FF000006670063A58FD159297A7A7684573065B900100002FF000000300200100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拜托了！为玛沙那找到\n传说中的瑜伽大师吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DC62584E86FF014E3A739B6C9990A3627E5230000A4F208BF44E2D7684745C4F3D59275E085427300200100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "据说，传说中的瑜伽大师\n就在5个圆形之中的0点的位置，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n那个圆中最接近天空的地方。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "636E8BF4FF0C4F208BF44E2D7684745C4F3D59275E08000A5C31572800354E2A57065F624E4B4E2D7684003070B976844F4D7F6EFF0C00100001BE00000A90A34E2A57064E2D670063A58FD159297A7A7684573065B9300200100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "恰雷姆，\n今天的修行就到这里吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "607096F759C6FF0C000A4ECA592976844FEE884C5C3152308FD991CC542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你好，\n有什么事吗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60597DFF0C000A67094EC04E484E8B5417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "确实，\n有些人会称我为大师。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƝ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "786E5B9EFF0C000A67094E9B4EBA4F1A79F062114E3A59275E083002001000020114019D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那你今天来找我是有什么事呢？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƝ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34F604ECA59296765627E6211662F67094EC04E484E8B5462FF1F001000020114019D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的玛沙那\n很难坚持集中注意力。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62117684739B6C9990A3000A5F8896BE575A630196C64E2D6CE8610F529B300200100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了让它能坚持集中注意力，\n我平时都会让它好好吃饭，可是……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E868BA95B8380FD575A630196C64E2D6CE8610F529BFF0C000A62115E7365F690FD4F1A8BA95B83597D597D5403996DFF0C53EF662F2026202600100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "问题就在这里！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƝ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "95EE98985C3157288FD991CCFF01001000020114019D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "玛沙那其实\n每天只吃1个树果就好。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƝ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "739B6C9990A351765B9E000A6BCF592953EA540300314E2A6811679C5C31597D3002001000020114019D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是吃得太多，\n反而会对身体造成负担哦。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƝ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F54035F97592A591AFF0C000A53CD800C4F1A5BF98EAB4F53902062108D1F62C554E63002001000020114019D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怎……怎么会这样啊～<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "600E20262026600E4E484F1A8FD96837554AFF5E00100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请放心。\n让我从基础开始教你们吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƝ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF7653E5FC33002000A8BA962114ECE57FA78405F0059CB65594F604EEC54273002001000020114019D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "谢谢您！\n真不愧是传说中的瑜伽大师！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8C228C2260A8FF01000A771F4E0D6127662F4F208BF44E2D7684745C4F3D59275E08FF0100100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咩呷！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54A95477FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也要谢谢你\n帮我找到瑜伽大师！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F89818C228C224F60000A5E2E6211627E5230745C4F3D59275E08FF0100100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然没法像玛沙那一样吃得那么少，\n但我也把食量稍微减少一点好了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D71366CA16CD550CF739B6C9990A34E00683754035F9790A34E485C11FF0C000A4F4662114E5F628A98DF91CF7A0D5FAE51CF5C114E0070B9597D4E86300200100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要和玛沙那一起冥想，\n我就会忍不住一个人睡着。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA8981548C739B6C9990A34E008D7751A560F3FF0C000A62115C314F1A5FCD4E0D4F4F4E004E2A4EBA77617740300200100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "集中注意力的能力\n是经过训练才能提高的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƝ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96C64E2D6CE8610F529B768480FD529B000A662F7ECF8FC78BAD7EC3624D80FD63D09AD876843002001000020114019D0000",
